  data: {
    LLM: '1. Starting: The player holding the Ace of Spades leads the first trick.\n2. Following Suit: Every player must follow the suit led.\n3. Winning a Trick: The highest card of the suit led wins the trick. The winner leads the next trick.\n4. The Penalty: If a player cannot follow suit, the trick ends immediately. That player must pick up all cards currently on the table and add them to their hand. That player then leads the next trick.',
    Player: '1. Starting: The player holding the Ace of Spades leads the first trick.\n2. Following Suit: Every player must follow the suit led.\n3. Winning a Trick: The highest card of the suit led wins the trick. The winner leads the next trick.\n4. The Penalty: If a player cannot follow suit, the trick ends immediately. That player must pick up all cards currently on the table and add them to their hand. That player then leads the next trick.',
    objective: "Get rid of all your cards. The last player remaining with cards is the 'Donkey'.",
